{"connection_id":"BC-2b80f2709f6275afa6dd","ref":"WLC:Prov.30.27","status":"rejected","reason":"Locusts march without a king; they do not form a bee hive or a herd that follows a leading animal, so the opposite scene is too remote.","paragraphs":[],"evidence":["WLC:Prov.30.27"],"annotations":[]}

